.Dd July 31, 2026
.Dt LIBORACLECTL 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm oraclectl_open ,
.Nm oraclectl_status ,
.Nm oraclectl_reload ,
.Nm oraclectl_shutdown
.Nd bounded client API for the oracled control socket
.Sh LIBRARY
Oracled control client library
.Pq Fl loraclectl
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In oraclectl.h
.Ft int
.Fn oraclectl_open "const char *path"
.Ft int
.Fn oraclectl_status "int fd" "struct oraclectl_status *status" "char *summary" "size_t summary_size"
.Ft int
.Fn oraclectl_reload "int fd" "char *summary" "size_t summary_size"
.Ft int
.Fn oraclectl_shutdown "int fd"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
library implements the one-shot administrative protocol used by
.Xr oracled 8 .
Applications normally use
.Xr oraclectl 8 ;
these routines are intended for system-management tools.
.Pp
.Fn oraclectl_open
opens an owned close-on-exec local-domain stream connection.
A null
.Fa path
selects the default
.Pa /var/run/oracled.sock .
Each connection carries exactly one request and reply and must be closed by
the caller after the operation returns.
.Pp
.Fn oraclectl_status
returns daemon status and a bounded, nul-terminated textual summary.
The
.Fa status
and
.Fa summary
arguments may be null when their results are not needed.
.Fn oraclectl_reload
requests a transactional configuration reload and optionally returns its
summary.
.Fn oraclectl_shutdown
requests managed shutdown.
.Pp
Reads and writes have 30-second socket deadlines.
Writes suppress
.Dv SIGPIPE .
Replies with truncated headers or summary sizes above the protocol limit are
rejected.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn oraclectl_open
returns an owned descriptor on success and -1 on failure with
.Va errno
set.
The operation routines return zero on success or an errno value for transport,
protocol, authorization, or daemon errors.
.Sh ERRORS
In addition to errors from
.Xr socket 2 ,
.Xr connect 2 ,
.Xr send 2 ,
and
.Xr recv 2 ,
the routines may return:
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Bq Er EPROTO
The reply is malformed or exceeds a protocol bound.
.It Bq Er ECONNRESET
The daemon closed the connection before a complete reply arrived.
.It Bq Er EAGAIN
A send or receive deadline expired.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr oraclectl 8 ,
.Xr oracled 8
